501
00:26:50,290 --> 00:26:53,440
If you're coming from a
skilled nursing facility,

502
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:56,290
if you are in a skilled
nursing facility,

503
00:26:56,290 --> 00:27:00,600
you're probably old because
younger people don't typically

504
00:27:00,600 --> 00:27:02,560
