573
00:30:39,330 --> 00:30:41,610
So here's an
interesting question,

574
00:30:41,610 --> 00:30:43,380
a little bit related
to something you'll

575
00:30:43,380 --> 00:30:46,800
see on the next problem set.

576
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:50,520
So could we predict
in-hospital mortality

577
00:30:50,520 --> 00:30:52,305
