00:33:34,180 --> 00:33:36,310
And of course, there's
this funny phrase,

628
00:33:36,310 --> 00:33:38,470
the wonderful thing
about standards

629
00:33:38,470 --> 00:33:41,530
is that there's so
many to choose from.

630
00:33:41,530 --> 00:33:44,770
So for example, if you look
