631
00:33:44,770 --> 00:33:49,280
database, here are two
particular prescriptions

632
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:53,800
for subject number
57139 admitted

633
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:58,690
on admission ID 155470.

634
00:33:58,690 --> 00:34:03,310
And so they have the same start
