636
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:13,469
and the other is for clobetasol
propionate 0.05% cream.

637
00:34:13,469 --> 00:34:16,960
That's a skin lotion thing for--

638
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:20,530
I think it's a
