658
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:40,270
The dose here is one
application, whatever that is.

659
00:35:40,270 --> 00:35:42,640
I don't know what
the 0.01 means.

660
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:45,370
And this is a tablet
and that's a tube.

661
00:35:45,370 --> 00:35:47,260
And this is taken orally.

662
00:35:47,260 --> 00:35:51,970
That's administered
on the skin, right?

663
00:35:51,970 --> 00:35:55,230
So this is a local database.

664
00:35:55,230 --> 00:36:00,490
AUDIENCE: For a doctor,
they just [INAUDIBLE]

665
00:36:00,490 --> 00:36:03,250
PROFESSOR: At most
hospitals, that's true now.

666
00:36:03,250 --> 00:36:05,350
It wasn't true when
